 "title": "Pliny Sailed Toward It",
 "sentences": [
  "When Vesuvius erupted, one Roman admiral sailed straight toward it.",
  "Pliny the Elder commanded the Roman fleet at Misenum.",
  "A message came from a woman named Rectina, begging to be rescued.",
  "He launched warships and crossed the bay as ash and pumice fell on the decks.",
  "He couldn't land near her, so he sailed on to a friend's villa at Stabiae.",
  "The next day he collapsed on the beach and died, perhaps from the fumes.",
  "His nephew, Pliny the Younger, later told the whole story.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
 ],
